function renderQuickLogins(){const container=$('#quickLoginAccounts');if(!container)return;const roleOrder=['admin','supervisor','sales','technician'],roleNames={admin:'Yönetici',supervisor:'Servis Süpervisörü',sales:'Satış Mühendisi',technician:'Servis Teknisyeni'},users=roleOrder.map(role=>userDirectory.find(user=>user.role===role)).filter(Boolean);container.innerHTML=`<p>Demo hızlı giriş</p>${users.map(user=>`<button type="button" data-quick-login="${escapeHtml(user.username)}"><span class="demo-avatar">${escapeHtml(user.initials)}</span><span><b>${escapeHtml(roleNames[user.role])}</b><small>${escapeHtml(user.name)}</small></span></button>`).join('')}<small>Bir kullanıcı tipini seçerek doğrudan giriş yapabilirsiniz.</small>`}
function recordDate(item){const value=item.plannedDateIso||item.requestDateIso||item.estimatedInstallationDate||item.estimatedDeliveryDate;if(value&&/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(value))return new Date(`${value}T12:00:00`);const display=[item.date,item.requestDate].find(text=>/\d{4}/.test(text||'')),match=String(display||'').match(/(\d{1,2})\s+([A-Za-zÇĞİÖŞÜçğıöşü]+)\s+(\d{4})/),months={oca:0,şub:1,mar:2,nis:3,may:4,haz:5,tem:6,ağu:7,eyl:8,eki:9,kas:10,ara:11};return match&&months[match[2].toLocaleLowerCase('tr-TR')]!==undefined?new Date(Number(match[3]),months[match[2].toLocaleLowerCase('tr-TR')],Number(match[1])):null}
function populateInstallationFilters(){const years=[...new Set(installations.map(item=>recordDate(item)?.getFullYear()).filter(Boolean))].sort((a,b)=>b-a),sales=[...new Set(installations.map(item=>item.salesEngineer).filter(Boolean))].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'tr')),customers=[...new Set(installations.map(item=>item.customer).filter(Boolean))].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'tr'));$('#yearFilter').innerHTML='<option value="">Tüm yıllar</option>'+years.map(value=>`<option>${value}</option>`).join('');$('#salesFilter').innerHTML='<option value="">Tüm satış mühendisleri</option>'+sales.map(value=>`<option>${escapeHtml(value)}</option>`).join('');$('#customerFilter').innerHTML='<option value="">Tüm müşteriler</option>'+customers.map(value=>`<option>${escapeHtml(value)}</option>`).join('')}
