function statusClass(status){return {'Taslak':'draft','Devam ediyor':'progress','Planlandı':'planned','Tamamlandı':'completed','Planlama bekliyor':'waiting','Sevkiyat bekliyor':'waiting','Süre aşıldı':'overrun'}[status] || 'planned'}
function rowTemplate(item){return `<tr><td><strong>${escapeHtml(item.customer)}</strong><small>${escapeHtml(item.salesOrderNumber)} · ${escapeHtml(item.ptd)}</small></td><td><span class="status ${statusClass(item.status)}">${item.status}</span></td><td><strong>${item.date}</strong><small>09:00</small></td><td><div class="technician"><span class="mini-avatar">${item.initials}</span>${escapeHtml(item.tech)}</div></td><td><span class="progress-bar"><i style="width:${item.progress}%"></i></span><small>%${item.progress}</small></td><td><button class="row-action" aria-label="Detay">›</button></td></tr>`}
function installationRowTemplate(item){const canPlan=currentUser?.role==='supervisor',canEdit=currentUser?.role==='sales',canService=['supervisor','technician'].includes(currentUser?.role)&&!['draft','awaitingPlanning'].includes(item.workflowStage),canDelete=canEdit&&['draft','awaitingPlanning'].includes(item.workflowStage);const deleteAction=canDelete?`<button class="row-action planning-action danger-action" data-delete-installation-id="${item.id}">Sil</button>`:'';let actions;if(canPlan)actions=`<div class="row-actions"><button class="row-action planning-action secondary-action" data-installation-id="${item.id}">Planla</button>${canService?`<button class="row-action planning-action" data-service-entry-id="${item.id}">Servis kaydı</button>`:''}</div>`;else if(canEdit)actions=`<div class="row-actions"><button class="row-action planning-action secondary-action" data-record-edit-id="${item.id}">Düzenle</button>${item.workflowStage==='draft'?`<button class="row-action planning-action" data-send-planning-id="${item.id}">Planlamaya gönder</button>`:`<button class="row-action planning-action" data-installation-id="${item.id}">Sevkiyat</button>`}${deleteAction}</div>`;else if(canService)actions=`<button class="row-action planning-action" data-service-entry-id="${item.id}">Servis kaydı</button>`;else actions=`<button class="row-action" data-record-detail-id="${item.id}" aria-label="Detay">›</button>`;return `<tr class="${item.serviceOverrun?'service-overrun-row':''}" data-record-id="${item.id}" tabindex="0"><td><strong>${escapeHtml(item.customer)}</strong><small>${escapeHtml(item.ptd)}</small></td><td><strong>${escapeHtml(item.salesOrderNumber)}</strong></td><td>${escapeHtml(item.requestDate)}</td><td><strong>${escapeHtml(item.salesEngineer)}</strong></td><td><span class="status ${statusClass(item.status)}">${item.status}</span>${item.serviceOverrun?'<small class="overrun-label">PLANLANAN SÜRE AŞILDI</small>':''}</td><td><strong>${escapeHtml(item.date)}</strong>${item.plannedDuration?`<small>${item.plannedDuration} ${escapeHtml(item.plannedUnit)}</small>`:''}</td><td><div class="technician"><span class="mini-avatar">${item.initials}</span>${escapeHtml(item.tech)}</div></td><td><span class="progress-bar"><i style="width:${item.progress}%"></i></span><small>%${item.progress}</small></td><td>${actions}</td></tr>`}
function escapeHtml(value){return String(value).replace(/[&<>'"]/g,char=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;',"'":'&#39;','"':'&quot;'}[char]))}
function normalizeSearch(value){return String(value||'').toLocaleLowerCase('tr-TR').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').replace(/ı/g,'i')}
function hideAccountSuggestions(config=activeAccountSearch){if(config){$(config.list).classList.add('role-hidden');$(config.list).innerHTML=''}if(!config||activeAccountSearch===config){accountMatches=[];activeAccountMatch=-1;activeAccountSearch=null}}
function renderAccountSuggestions(query,config){if(activeAccountSearch&&activeAccountSearch!==config)hideAccountSuggestions(activeAccountSearch);activeAccountSearch=config;const normalized=normalizeSearch(query.trim());if(normalized.length<2){hideAccountSuggestions(config);return}accountMatches=accountDirectory.filter(account=>normalizeSearch(account.name).includes(normalized)).sort((a,b)=>{const aStart=normalizeSearch(a.name).startsWith(normalized),bStart=normalizeSearch(b.name).startsWith(normalized);return Number(bStart)-Number(aStart)||a.name.localeCompare(b.name,'tr')}).slice(0,8);activeAccountMatch=-1;const list=$(config.list);if(!accountMatches.length){hideAccountSuggestions(config);return}list.innerHTML=accountMatches.map((account,index)=>`<button type="button" role="option" data-account-index="${index}"><strong>${escapeHtml(account.name)}</strong>${account.address?`<small>${escapeHtml(account.address)}</small>`:''}</button>`).join('');list.classList.remove('role-hidden')}
function selectAccount(account,config=activeAccountSearch){if(!account||!config)return;$(config.input).value=account.name;hideAccountSuggestions(config);pendingAccount=account;pendingAddressField=config.address;if(!account.address){showToast('Bu firma için kayıtlı adres bulunamadı.');$(`[name="${config.address}"]`).focus();return}$('#selectedAccountName').textContent=account.name;$('#selectedAccountAddress').textContent=account.address;$('#selectedAddressQuestion').textContent=`Bu adres ${config.label} olarak kullanılsın mı?`;$('#addressSuggestionDialog').showModal()}
